{
  "source": "Prompts/why-answers-vary-6.mp4",
  "duration": 121.7886875,
  "segments": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.74,
      "text": "You ask AI, what should I name my new dog?"
    },
    {
      "start": 3.28,
      "end": 4.34,
      "text": "It suggests Spot."
    },
    {
      "start": 5.0,
      "end": 8.42,
      "text": "You start a new chat and ask the exact same question."
    },
    {
      "start": 9.04,
      "end": 10.52,
      "text": "This time, it suggests Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 11.5,
      "end": 13.8,
      "text": "Why did the same question get a different answer?"
    },
    {
      "start": 14.62,
      "end": 17.36,
      "text": "This overview shows why AI responses change."
    },
    {
      "start": 18.18,
      "end": 21.82,
      "text": "First, the model you use and its thinking time changes the answer."
    },
    {
      "start": 22.44,
      "end": 27.48,
      "text": "Second, what the AI receives, like your prompt and context, alters the output."
    },
    {
      "start": 27.48,
      "end": 32.32,
      "text": "Finally, AI uses selection techniques, giving different tokens a chance."
    },
    {
      "start": 32.96,
      "end": 34.2,
      "text": "This causes the variation."
    },
    {
      "start": 35.2,
      "end": 38.66,
      "text": "Two techniques explain AI's choices, sampling and temperature."
    },
    {
      "start": 39.64,
      "end": 43.28,
      "text": "In this breakdown, Spot leads with a 22% probability,"
    },
    {
      "start": 43.68,
      "end": 46.92,
      "text": "meaning AI picks it 22 times out of 100 on average."
    },
    {
      "start": 47.52,
      "end": 48.08,
      "text": "That's sampling."
    },
    {
      "start": 48.82,
      "end": 53.38,
      "text": "Five random picks yield Max, Spot, Buddy, Rex, and Max."
    },
    {
      "start": 54.16,
      "end": 55.9,
      "text": "Another five could look completely different."
    },
    {
      "start": 55.9,
      "end": 60.52,
      "text": "Choosing the most likely token every single time creates repetitive loops."
    },
    {
      "start": 61.44,
      "end": 65.18,
      "text": "Giving other likely tokens a chance adds variety, prevents repetitive answers,"
    },
    {
      "start": 65.64,
      "end": 68.04,
      "text": "and completely shapes the direction of the following text."
    },
    {
      "start": 68.98,
      "end": 70.96,
      "text": "Sampling selects a token using probabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 72.36,
      "end": 73.6,
      "text": "Temperature adjusts those probabilities."
    },
    {
      "start": 74.42,
      "end": 79.02,
      "text": "In chat GPT, Gemini, and Claude, temperature is set for you behind the scenes."
    },
    {
      "start": 79.78,
      "end": 81.4,
      "text": "This table illustrates these adjustments."
    },
    {
      "start": 81.98,
      "end": 85.04,
      "text": "The center column shows baseline odds from AI's training."
    },
    {
      "start": 85.04,
      "end": 88.26,
      "text": "Lowering temperature concentrates probability,"
    },
    {
      "start": 88.66,
      "end": 92.26,
      "text": "moving Spot from 22 to 36%."
    },
    {
      "start": 92.26,
      "end": 98.42,
      "text": "Conversely, high temperature spreads probability widely, dropping Spot to 16%."
    },
    {
      "start": 98.42,
      "end": 103.34,
      "text": "Both manipulate the exact same starting odds to control response variety."
    },
    {
      "start": 104.12,
      "end": 107.28,
      "text": "Spot remains the most likely individual token at all three settings."
    },
    {
      "start": 108.44,
      "end": 109.78,
      "text": "Temperature changes its probability."
    },
    {
      "start": 110.86,
      "end": 112.72,
      "text": "And so the core rule remains."
    },
    {
      "start": 112.72,
      "end": 114.44,
      "text": "AI answers vary."
    },
    {
      "start": 115.36,
      "end": 118.24,
      "text": "Different inputs, different odds, different choices."
    }
  ],
